# Battle Visual Feedback System

## Combat Visualization
### Health Display
- Clear health bar visualization
- Smooth health updates
- Color-coded status indicators
- Damage number popups

### Combat Effects
- Attack animations
- Damage effects
- Capture progress indicators
- Status effect visualization

## Movement Feedback
### Battalion Movement
- Smooth movement animations
- Clear direction indicators
- Path visualization
- Speed indicators

### Position Updates
- Real-time position tracking
- Network line adherence
- Range indicators
- Collision avoidance visualization

## State Indicators
### Battalion Status
- Type Indicators
  - Breacher: "B" tag in top-left corner (must be outside rotated container)
  - Guardian: "G" tag in top-left corner
  - Phreak: "P" tag in top-left corner
  - Tag styling:
    - Dark background (rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7))
    - White text
    - Small font size (8pt)
    - Bold weight
    - Rounded corners
  - Position: Consistent top-left placement for all types
  - Always visible during battle
  - IMPORTANT: For breachers, type tag and mark indicators must be rendered outside the rotated diamond shape to prevent clipping
- Mark Indicators
  - Display format: "Mk{number}" in top-right corner
  - Must remain visible even for rotated breacher units
  - Same styling as type indicators
- Current target indication
- Attack range visualization
- Health status
- Special effects (if any)

### Node Status
- Control state indication
- Capture progress
- Network connection visualization
- Valid target highlighting

